#: substance_textures_importer/propertygroups.py:193
msgid "Disable to use DirectX™ normal map format instead of OpenGL.                        \n                        \n When this option is disabled, the script inverts the Y channel                        \n of the normal map to match blender format by adding a RGBCurve                        \n node with the green channel curve inverted before a normal map                        \n is plugged during Nodes Trees setup"
msgstr "禁用后使用 DirectX™ 法线贴图格式而非 OpenGL。禁用此选项时，脚本会在设置节点树期间、连接法线贴图之前，添加一个绿色通道曲线反转的 RGB 曲线节点，以反转法线贴图的 Y 通道来匹配 Blender 格式。"

