#: substance_textures_importer/propertygroups.py:240
msgid "Selector for the separator used to detect multi-sockets.                        \n If your texture map name contains multiple keywords like                        \n material_bump,metallic,ambient.exr , material_bump-metallic-ambient.exr                        \n or material_bump;metallic;ambient.exr etc.                         \n Adjust this to fit the separator character between your maps keywords."
msgstr "用于检测多接口的分隔符选择器。如果纹理贴图名称包含多个关键字，例如 material_bump,metallic,ambient.exr、material_bump-metallic-ambient.exr 或 material_bump;metallic;ambient.exr 等，请调整此项以匹配贴图关键字之间的分隔符。"

